  "description": "A lightweight and reusable .NET library for handling secure and organized file uploads. Supports configurable maximum file size, allowed extensions, and flexible folder organization. Uploads can now be seamlessly routed to either the default wwwroot or any custom directory using the new FileUploadOptions. Automatically generates unique filenames and returns relative paths for easy integration with your application's BaseUrl. Fully documented with XML comments for an enhanced developer experience.",
  "iconFile": "Matrixs Image.jpeg",
